<section class="section tight"><div class="container"><div class="utility-panel"><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q"><span>How does eJuno help couples today?</span><span>+</span></div><div class="faq-a">eJuno brings together venue discovery, wedding services, planning tools, inspiration and support across its current public experience.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q"><span>Can I book or enquire through eJuno?</span><span>+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Where the current eJuno journey supports enquiry or booking, the redesigned interface continues into that existing flow.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q"><span>Does this redesign add new product functionality?</span><span>+</span></div><div class="faq-a">No. V4 changes the experience layer and visual organisation. Backend-dependent actions remain current functionality or are clearly simulated in the prototype.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q"><span>Is the design locked to Italy forever?</span><span>+</span></div><div class="faq-a">No. The current content can remain Italy-led while the visual system and information architecture are scalable to additional markets later.</div></div><div style="margin-top:24px"><a class="btn primary" href="/pages/contact">Contact eJuno</a></div></div></div></section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Faqs content",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "ejuno-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "editor_note",
      "label": "Editor note",
      "default": "Content below keeps the approved prototype structure."
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "item",
      "name": "Content item",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "Image"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "eyebrow",
          "label": "Eyebrow",
          "default": "Item"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "Title",
          "default": "Content item"
        },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Text",
          "default": "Add supporting content."
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "url",
          "label": "Link"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 24,
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Faqs content"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
